XFAIL: system-windows

A child started in a directory whose name has spaces and non-ASCII
characters runs there through catter.
Known failures: #127 (non-ASCII directories on Windows).

RUN: %e2e probe cwd | FileCheck %s
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t.json -- %e2e probe cwd | FileCheck %s

CHECK: PASS cwd
